      "content": "wait a second, what do you mean \"just as a goblin would eagerly await arrival of a new treasure\"? that's a really weird way to describe a luggage delivery service lol. \n\ncan we just stick to the logistics? i'm trying to figure out the actual timing. if i drop the cases off at my hotel in tokyo on a monday morning, can i realistically expect them to be at my osaka hotel by tuesday afternoon, or is that cutting it too close? also, is there a specific way i should label them so they don't get lost in the shuffle?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
